==History==
2023
*The Royal Giant's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 19/6/2023, in the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]].
*On 21/6/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (21/6/2023)|maintenance break]], fixed the deploy sound effects of the Evolved Royal Giant.
*On 30/6/2023, a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(30/6/2023)|maintenance break]], decreased the Evolved Royal Giant's hitpoints to 120% of the original's (from 130%) and removed his area damage.
*On 8/8/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(8/8/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Royal Giant's hitpoints to 110% of the original's (from 120%).
2024
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Royal Giant's hitpoints by 3%, but removed his hitpoints boost.
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]], made it so that hovering [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] would no longer be immune to Evolved Royal Giant's recoil.
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Royal Giant after death.
2026

* On 2/3/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Royal Giant's hitpoints to 1.7 seconds (from 1.8 seconds).

